h girls like  Levesque who despite the generation gap  share the same dream these women once  had to play baseball at the professional  level and a lot of people don't think  girls could play baseball so you just  gotta accept that they don't think you  can play and just go and show them  differently on the ball field this month  marks 25 years since the release of a  league of their own and despite being  one of the most successful baseball  movies in history tournament organizers  say little has been done by the major  leagues to create an avenue for girls  wanting to play at that level tarika  thank you very much for that appreciate  it
 

